# This is the exact block the engine itself maintains (E25-H06: lodestar
# rewrites its managed .gitignore entries idempotently, byte for byte). We keep
# it verbatim instead of a broader `.lodestar/` so the demo shows the real
# behaviour of the product — and so the engine never needs to touch this file.
# lodestar: cache y runtime desechables (no versionar)
.lodestar/index.db
.lodestar/runtime/
